```css
.gradient {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 50%, #f093fb 100%);
}
```

This runs diagonally from indigo through purple to pink. Change the angle (`135deg`) or the color stops to adjust it, or swap `linear-gradient` for `radial-gradient` or `conic-gradient` for a different shape.

```css
.gradient {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff7e5f 0%, #feb47b 50%, #86a8e7 100%);
}
```

This runs diagonally from a warm coral through peach to a soft blue. Swap the angle (`135deg`) or the color stops to adjust the direction and palette.

